			"notes": "The Spring Festival is about to come. Happy new year! \nWell, I've been back home from school for 2 weeks. I got more time to develop this mod. Now let's see what I had done.\n- Friendly fire config\n- Nature multipliers\n- Failed captures can be counted as provocation\n- Wild Pokemon will no longer be taunted if do_pokemon_attack_unprovoked is set to false\n- Reworked Poke Staff\n  - It will affect the party Pokemon you selected on the left side of your screen now.\n  - Added keybinds for Poke Staff, no default keybinds. Choose the ones you need.\n- Reworked damage calculation\n  - Slightly increased the Pokemons' damage\n  - Maximum damage and minimum damage no longer take part in the damage calculation. They're just a limit now.\n  - The default value of the maximum damage is increased to 50.(Very hard to reach by default. Please notice that this won't change your value automatically if you're updating this from an old version)\n- Fix the bug that wild range attackers attack players in battle"
		},
